@startuml 006-sequence-navigation
title 006 時序圖：老師登入後落地與側邊選單切換
skinparam backgroundColor #FAF7F0
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F0E6
  ParticipantBorderColor #1F3A93
  ArrowColor #1F3A93
  LifeLineBorderColor #1F3A93
}
autonumber

actor "老師" as T
participant "LoginPage" as LP
participant "AppRoutes + Guard" as R
participant "TeacherLayout" as L
participant "SideMenu" as M
participant "ActivityControlPage" as A
participant "StudentManagePage" as S

T -> LP : 以老師帳號登入
LP -> R : navigate(homePathFor(TEACHER) = /teacher)
R -> R : Guard(role=TEACHER)
R -> A : 顯示搶答活動（/teacher 即搶答活動）
A -> L : 以 TeacherLayout 包住內容
T -> L : 按左上角三條線按鈕
L -> M : open = true
M --> T : 左側選單：搶答活動（目前）、題目管理、學生管理
alt 點選「學生管理」
  T -> M : 點選
  M -> R : navigate(/teacher/students)
  M -> L : onClose()
  R -> R : Guard(role=TEACHER)
  R -> S : 顯示學生帳號建立、學生清單與組別管理
else 點選選單外、再按按鈕或按 Esc
  T -> M : 關閉
  M -> L : onClose()（停留原畫面，焦點回到選單按鈕）
end
@enduml
